// Dialog :
"P4223488864" "What did you find in those sewers, {HeroName}? ...?! A list of <i>body parts</i> to be taken from the attendees of the play?! That's not good at all! ... Well, <i>obviously</i> that's not good at all, I probably didn't have to say it.<br><br>I just hope that their leader, <color yellow>Dr. Vahzilok</color>, isn't in on this. The guy's a total nutcase, he thinks he's working to make the world a better place by making these abominations from the body parts of people!<br><br>We need to warn the manager of the theater about the Vahzilok <i>and</i> make sure to stop them. That charity event needs to happen, {HeroName}, we <i>have</i> to help the people of Galaxy!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - FIELDS2VARS 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3008829260" "Hello there! Pleasure to meet you, {HeroName}, correct? Name's Victoria Manuel, {Hero.gender=male but you can call me Vicky.|it's a pleasure to make your acquaintance.}<br><br>That little darling of a man, Officer Fields, told me that the little brats in the Vahzilok are up to no good, hurm?"
// Answer Text :
"P238553323" "That's right. They're targeting people attending your event."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P1256866129" "How annoying! You try to run one little event in this place and you get mad scientists trying to use the audience as body parts.<br><br>Well, I'm sure {Hero.gender=male a fine man like yourself|a capable woman like yourself} can handle a few men with meat cleavers, hmm? I'd especially hope so, given that I've heard some of the people on my list have gone missing!<br><br> I'm just <i>so</i> busy at the moment, I can't imagine trying to juggle all of this!"
// Answer Text :
"P3151225991" "I know you used to be a hero. You can do something to help with this."
// Answer Text :
"P4106347422" "Don't worry. I'll handle this, you focus on the charity event."
// Page HelpMe Text :
"P2943237237" "Eh? Oh, no, I gave up my mantle a while ago, {Hero.gender=male sweetie|sweetheart}. It's too late for me to pick that back up again.<br><br>I'm flattered you think that, though. I think you and I should split up on this, hrm? I'll handle the charity here, and you can handle the group of Vahzilok that seem to be encroaching on the event.<br><br>Oh, that's right, I forgot to mention that. I just received a message that the PPD have spotted a group of them nearby. I'd love it if you could handle them. Ta!"
// Answer Text :
"P2051700004" "... Right."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P2432330786" "You're the best {Hero.gender=male hun.|sugar!} I <i>could</i> help you a bit.<br><br>I just got a message from the PPD that a group of those Vahzilok were seen nearby. I'm betting they must be planning on attacking my little event!<br><br>Here, let me show you where they are. If I were you, I'd really go over and put the stop on them. Meanwhile, I'll see about getting this event of mine underway."
// Answer Text :
"P4086069132" "I'll handle it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3238633682" "The safest thing to do in this situation would be to stop the charity event. The Vahzilok clearly want to launch a <i>major</i> attack on it.<br><br>But the people left over from Galaxy <i>need</i> this event, {HeroName}. We have to make sure this goes off without a hitch.<br><br>The remaining PPD are going to do their best to play security, but we need everyone on our side. I think the manager of the theater might be able to help."
// AcceptString :
"P2817404675" "What do you mean?"
// SendOffString :
"P810645455" "The theater manager, a woman named <color yellow>Victoria Manuel</color>, is a retired hero. Well, 'retired' is a strong word. She's barely in her thirties, but she gave up on the whole hero gig.<br><br>I'd see if you can talk to her and convince her to help us out while also trying to run the charity event. The more people we have helping us out, the better.<br><br>I'm going to try to see if I can find any clues as to <i>why</i> the Vahzilok would want to target these people specifically and who might be behind all of this."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P235196509" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Responsibility</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3213080504" "Speak with Victoria Manuel"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P706268095" "I've got nothing yet here, {HeroName}. How about you?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2592155312" "You spoke with Victoria Manuel and found out about a group of Vahzilok nearby!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1777841593" "Push back the Vahzilok near Victoria Manuel's theater"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3413614155" "They're already near the theater?! That's faster than I thought. You have to take care of the Vahzilok, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2837507354" "You stopped the Vahzilok and found a clue about their plans!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2681468075" "Good to see you made it back in one piece, {HeroName}. What did you find?<br><br>Whoa, a note from Dr. Vahzilok himself! And what's this about Botte?! Larry Botte is dead! Unless... his brother Joseph! This is getting crazier by the minute.<br><br>On the one hand, at <i>least</i> Dr. Vahzilok's goal isn't a moustache-twirling plot to destroy the charity event. On the <i>other</i> hand, he seems to be putting his own 'scientific' goals above the well-being of those people!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P311920650" "This all adds up, {HeroName}. While you were gone, I was doing some digging and found some very <i>odd</i> spikes in power usage in a specific part of the sewer system.<br><br>I'm betting that Joseph Botte is in there with the Vahzilok, performing various experiments, and <i>that</i> is probably where they have the people they've <i>already</i> kidnapped!"
// AcceptString :
"P1989032637" "Then there's no time to lose."
// SendOffString :
"P922231387" "Right! Here's the location of the sewer system.<br><br>I don't know what drove Joseph Botte to this, but it's up to you to stop it. Let's hope you can save the hostages down there just like you saved the hostages from the Hellions.<br><br>I'd be careful, if I were you. You're walking deep into Vahzilok territory."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2248823627" "Stop the Vahzilok plot against the Promenade"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1007181871" "The charity event is safe, for now, but the Vahzilok could attack it at any moment!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1492147406" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: No Guarantee</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P353549547" "A putrid smell fills the sewers. It definitely isn't the smell of sewage - you probably don't want to know <i>what</i> exactly the smell is."

