// SaysList :
"P3207569352" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>You're a fool, {HeroName}! <t=6 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>Look at the times we live in. Cities being destroyed in the blink of an eye! <t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>How do you expect a person to live in a world with no guarantees? No safety? <t=6 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>Dr. Vahzilok has promised all of his followers safety... -immortality-! Can you do that, {HeroName}?! <t=6 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>The people at this event are sacrifices for a greater cause, the cause of immortality! <t=6 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>My new body will be complete... I will live forever, and then, I will give my gift to all the people of Paragon! I.. -we-... we will all NEVER have to be afraid of anything, EVER again!"
// SaysList :
"P515930341" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>This is Officer Fields, can you hear me? <t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Matthew Habashy sent me some intel on Botte! He's being powered up by something called a Life Machine, you need to destroy it in order to hurt him!"

