// BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P3222764098" "Joseph Botte was once a calm and peaceful man, until the meteors hit Galaxy City. This caused Joseph to lose his grip on reality along with the belief that he could be safe. Dr. Vahzilok used this fear to lure Joseph Botte into his fold, using the man to spread his work, while promising him eternal life.<br><br>Joseph Botte is now fully enslaved to Dr. Vahzilok, willing to do anything if it means being able to live a safe life."

