// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4030353993" "You did it, {HeroName}! The hostages are being taken care of right now. Joseph Botte will be sitting in prison for a <i>very</i> long time,  and the charity event is going off as we speak!<br><br>I almost feel bad for Botte. Dr. Vahzilok took advantage of his fear after the Galaxy Incident... but to think of how desperate Botte must have been... killing your own <i>brother</i> for your safety?!<br><br>I'm happy we have people like you in the city, {HeroName}, to show us that we <i>can</i> be safe in this world without having to go to such extreme measures. ... Well, there's <i>also</i> us in the PPD, too. But it's always good to have a super-powered hero to have our backs!"

